WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.770
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.040 --> 00:05.840
Yok,

3
00:05.840 --> 00:07.320
help me get to the bathroom.

4
00:07.600 --> 00:08.320
Did you know...

5
00:08.360 --> 00:09.520
building a body like this...

6
00:09.520 --> 00:11.040
takes more than just working out?

7
00:11.120 --> 00:12.120
Put Itt

8
00:12.160 --> 00:13.320
in Corporate Development.

9
00:13.360 --> 00:15.160
-Yes. -As for Yok, you'll be my personal assistant.

10
00:15.560 --> 00:16.880
Today is extremely important.

11
00:17.000 --> 00:18.600
We need to close this deal at any cost.

12
00:18.680 --> 00:19.800
Normally...

13
00:19.840 --> 00:21.320
aren't you someone

14
00:21.360 --> 00:23.480
who can separate work from personal life?

15
00:23.520 --> 00:26.000
Taking care of my boss is part of my job.

16
00:46.400 --> 00:48.760
Sorry, I'm a side sleeper.

17
01:04.239 --> 01:04.879
What are you doing?

18
01:04.879 --> 01:06.240
I'm just trying to cover you up.

19
01:07.600 --> 01:08.720
Wait, where are you going?

20
01:08.760 --> 01:10.400
I'm just trying to tuck you in.

21
01:10.400 --> 01:11.640
It's nothing.

22
01:11.640 --> 01:13.400
Come here. I told you to cover up.

23
01:19.360 --> 01:20.280
That hurts.

24
01:51.400 --> 01:52.039
Wait...

25
01:52.360 --> 01:53.240
Wait, Yok.

26
02:03.520 --> 02:04.640
Are you into guys?

27
02:09.919 --> 02:10.600
Yeah.

28
02:16.240 --> 02:17.400
How do you feel about me?

29
02:19.680 --> 02:20.480
I like you.

30
02:24.440 --> 02:25.920
-But I'm not like that. -I know.

31
02:27.600 --> 02:29.360
You don't have to be like me or anything.

32
02:29.760 --> 02:30.960
I just like you.

33
02:35.480 --> 02:37.280
I've liked you since the first moment we met.

34
02:41.120 --> 02:41.920
Yok...

35
02:42.600 --> 02:44.560
Yok, wait, where are you going?

36
02:46.840 --> 02:47.640
I'm sorry.

37
02:48.079 --> 02:50.320
I don't know what the hell came over me.

38
02:50.320 --> 02:51.360
I'm really sorry.

39
02:53.520 --> 02:54.640
Yok, look...

40
02:56.520 --> 02:57.760
Seriously, where are you going?

41
02:57.760 --> 02:59.000
It's late.

42
02:59.040 --> 03:00.160
There are so many mosquitoes outside.

43
03:00.920 --> 03:01.360
How about...

44
03:01.400 --> 03:02.920
I go outside?

45
03:02.960 --> 03:04.040
You stay here.

46
03:06.760 --> 03:07.680
I didn't mean to do that.

47
06:20.520 --> 06:23.040
Oh, why are you sleeping in this room, Mr. Ing?

48
06:23.400 --> 06:24.600
You're going to catch a cold.

49
06:24.640 --> 06:25.680
I'm fine.

50
06:26.240 --> 06:27.400
I just felt like sleeping here.

51
06:28.600 --> 06:30.280
Wait, where's Yok?

52
06:30.760 --> 06:31.800
Has he left already?

53
06:32.080 --> 06:34.360
I saw him chatting with your grandpa.

54
06:34.880 --> 06:35.520
Huh?

55
06:36.800 --> 06:38.680
That record is extremely rare, Grandpa.

56
06:38.680 --> 06:39.440
It is.

57
06:39.440 --> 06:41.159
I've kept it since I was a young man.

58
06:52.680 --> 06:54.360
It's already 10 in the morning,

59
06:54.440 --> 06:55.960
and you're only just getting out of bed?

60
07:01.480 --> 07:02.880
Do you have any idea

61
07:02.920 --> 07:04.200
what I've been through these past two days?

62
07:04.520 --> 07:05.800
I still have a headache.

63
07:06.560 --> 07:07.880
I might have a fever.

64
07:10.600 --> 07:11.600
Stop acting like a baby.

65
07:11.640 --> 07:13.000
The medicine is right there.

66
07:13.040 --> 07:13.760
Take it.

67
07:15.280 --> 07:17.880
I'll have a little something to eat first.

68
07:21.400 --> 07:24.080
So, what were you two talking about?

69
07:24.960 --> 07:25.880
Nothing much.

70
07:27.920 --> 07:29.600
This boy is quite charming.

71
07:30.240 --> 07:32.200
Talking to an old man about vinyl records

72
07:32.240 --> 07:33.560
with such genuine interest.

73
07:33.680 --> 07:35.200
He really knows his stuff.

74
07:35.240 --> 07:36.440
He's very impressive.

75
07:36.880 --> 07:38.600
I think this boy...

76
07:38.720 --> 07:40.560
definitely has a brighter future than you do.

77
07:41.159 --> 07:43.440
Even you've taken a shine to him this quickly.

78
07:43.440 --> 07:45.000
He must be the real deal.

79
07:47.159 --> 07:50.080
I had Yong prepare a lot of gifts for you to take back.

80
07:51.280 --> 07:52.800
Come visit again when you're free.

81
07:53.240 --> 07:54.400
Grandpa, I'm not leaving soon.

82
07:54.440 --> 07:55.800
You don't have to be in such a rush.

83
07:56.840 --> 07:57.840
Who was talking to you?

84
07:59.400 --> 08:01.160
I was talking to Yok.

85
08:02.080 --> 08:03.280
Of course, Grandpa.

86
08:03.560 --> 08:05.160
I'll definitely be back.

87
08:05.680 --> 08:07.280
You're such a sweet kid.

88
08:08.240 --> 08:08.840
Grandpa...

89
08:09.960 --> 08:11.080
Just who is your actual grandson here?

90
08:16.040 --> 08:17.360
This looks delicious.

91
08:17.520 --> 08:18.440
Next time,

92
08:18.960 --> 08:19.720
I'll bring even more.

93
08:21.200 --> 08:21.880
Thank you.

94
08:21.880 --> 08:23.680
You're welcome.

95
08:33.080 --> 08:33.760
Hey.

96
08:37.000 --> 08:38.400
To be honest, I'm sorry.

97
08:38.400 --> 08:40.159
I was too impulsive yesterday.

98
08:42.480 --> 08:43.720
I like you, Yok.

99
08:43.760 --> 08:45.080
That's not wrong, is it?

100
08:45.360 --> 08:47.480
So I'm not going to stop liking you.

101
08:48.360 --> 08:50.720
I know you might not be into guys right now,

102
08:51.160 --> 08:53.280
but what if I'm the exception?

103
08:54.480 --> 08:58.080
If by some chance you end up liking me,

104
08:58.200 --> 08:59.200
I promise you that...

105
08:59.240 --> 09:00.920
I'll make you incredibly happy.

106
09:00.960 --> 09:01.680
Whatever you want,

107
09:01.720 --> 09:03.360
I'll get it all for you, okay?

108
09:04.160 --> 09:05.040
So...

109
09:06.080 --> 09:07.120
want to try dating?

110
09:12.400 --> 09:13.040
P'Ing.

111
09:13.040 --> 09:13.440
Yeah?

112
09:13.480 --> 09:15.080
I'm still talking to you 'cause I respect you.

113
09:15.600 --> 09:17.480
Please act like you deserve that respect.

114
09:17.920 --> 09:18.840
Yok, I get that

115
09:18.880 --> 09:20.880
this might be too fast for you.

116
09:21.080 --> 09:21.960
Honestly,

117
09:21.960 --> 09:23.720
in my world,

118
09:24.160 --> 09:26.640
there's nothing I want that I don't get.

119
09:28.480 --> 09:29.560
Don't tell me

120
09:29.600 --> 09:32.280
that you're going to quit just because of this.

121
09:33.200 --> 09:34.280
I have no intention of quitting.

122
09:34.280 --> 09:36.160
Oh, holding your own, I see.

123
09:36.600 --> 09:37.720
I like that.

124
09:43.160 --> 09:43.920
Oh...

125
09:44.520 --> 09:46.080
Things got tense suddenly.

126
09:48.240 --> 09:49.480
I'm feeling the pressure.

127
09:49.520 --> 09:50.400
I'd say you passed the test.

128
09:50.920 --> 09:53.480
You're really good at handling people.

129
09:53.520 --> 09:55.080
You're the perfect fit to work with me.

130
09:55.080 --> 09:56.640
You've got a lot of...

131
09:56.720 --> 09:57.840
What's it called?

132
09:58.000 --> 09:59.440
Patience, you know.

133
10:01.040 --> 10:01.720
Okay.

134
10:01.720 --> 10:03.360
Working together is going to be a blast.

135
10:07.920 --> 10:09.600
What's there to be so tired about?

136
10:10.400 --> 10:11.800
Fine, I'll pretend to be you for a second.

137
10:13.080 --> 10:14.040
"To be honest,

138
10:15.640 --> 10:17.320
I didn't like what you did."

139
10:17.320 --> 10:18.920
Is there no one you can talk to?

140
10:22.840 --> 10:24.520
I don't talk to anyone else.

141
10:24.680 --> 10:26.480
You are privileged here.

142
10:26.720 --> 10:28.640
I loved that tone of voice, though.

143
10:30.040 --> 10:32.640
"P'Ing, is there no one you can talk to?"

144
10:40.200 --> 10:40.960
Mr. Ing,

145
10:41.000 --> 10:43.120
I went to survey the site last week.

146
10:43.160 --> 10:44.480
The land looks pretty good.

147
10:45.040 --> 10:45.600
Okay.

148
10:46.280 --> 10:47.840
In that case, proceed with the plan.

149
10:48.600 --> 10:49.200
Mr. Ing...

150
10:49.320 --> 10:50.640
Hey, what's up?

151
10:50.680 --> 10:53.040
P'Ing, it's been a long time.

152
10:54.640 --> 10:55.200
Oh...

153
10:56.040 --> 10:57.200
Itt, you're here, too?

154
10:59.680 --> 11:00.840
And who is this?

155
11:02.840 --> 11:03.760
You're so handsome.

156
11:07.200 --> 11:08.960
Yok, this is Pite.

157
11:09.840 --> 11:11.040
He's my aunt's son,

158
11:11.120 --> 11:12.600
Itt's cousin.

159
11:13.000 --> 11:14.880
Hi, I'm Yok.

160
11:16.240 --> 11:18.400
Hi, I'm Pite.

161
11:19.520 --> 11:20.680
What do you want?

162
11:21.840 --> 11:22.840
Well...

163
11:23.520 --> 11:25.920
My friend offered this project to me.

164
11:25.960 --> 11:26.720
It's brilliant.

165
11:27.040 --> 11:29.720
Super low investment, massive returns.

166
11:29.760 --> 11:30.480
Really?

167
11:30.560 --> 11:31.280
-Yeah. -Then,

168
11:31.280 --> 11:32.600
why isn't your friend doing it?

169
11:33.440 --> 11:35.520
Well, the guy has zero capital.

170
11:35.680 --> 11:37.640
Oh, and you're saying you do?

171
11:38.640 --> 11:40.960
It's only ten million. What's the big deal?

172
11:43.520 --> 11:44.480
But my mom...

173
11:44.840 --> 11:46.800
forced me to talk to you first.

174
11:47.840 --> 11:49.560
-She's worried I'll get scammed. -I see.

175
11:50.280 --> 11:51.520
Your mom's got the right idea.

176
11:51.880 --> 11:53.360
Because in my opinion,

177
11:53.560 --> 11:55.200
you have no business sense at all.

178
11:55.840 --> 11:56.720
Come on,

179
11:57.080 --> 11:58.840
everyone has to start somewhere, right?

180
11:59.920 --> 12:00.800
Besides,

181
12:01.440 --> 12:02.960
I'm freaking 23 already.

182
12:03.280 --> 12:05.280
I don't wanna sponge off my parents forever.

183
12:05.360 --> 12:06.960
I want something of my own.

184
12:07.080 --> 12:08.120
Yeah, yeah.

185
12:09.080 --> 12:10.400
These are the project documents, right?

186
12:10.720 --> 12:11.400
Yes.

187
12:25.160 --> 12:26.080
Guys, look at this.

188
12:27.520 --> 12:29.280
Explain it in plain English

189
12:29.280 --> 12:30.000
so he understands.

190
12:35.560 --> 12:36.360
Mr. Ing,

191
12:36.800 --> 12:39.120
are these high-voltage power lines?

192
12:39.160 --> 12:40.480
Yeah. Tell him.

193
12:41.600 --> 12:43.480
You can't have any structures built

194
12:43.520 --> 12:45.000
directly underneath high-voltage lines.

195
12:45.360 --> 12:46.880
If you buy this land,

196
12:47.240 --> 12:48.720
you won't be able to build a thing.

197
12:48.960 --> 12:50.680
Plus, the ownership rights are murky at best.

198
12:52.600 --> 12:53.520
Did any of that sink in?

199
12:54.840 --> 12:55.960
It's plain as day in the photo

200
12:55.960 --> 12:57.640
that those power lines are right there.

201
12:57.800 --> 12:59.400
Have you even gone to survey the site yet?

202
12:59.720 --> 13:00.680
No, it's...

203
13:00.960 --> 13:01.960
I haven't gotten around to it yet.

204
13:02.000 --> 13:03.360
Oh, so you haven't even been there,

205
13:03.400 --> 13:04.480
but you're ready to put down ten million?

206
13:04.480 --> 13:05.400
You're so rich, huh?

207
13:05.880 --> 13:07.800
Well, that's why I wanted your opinion.

208
13:07.960 --> 13:10.760
Yeah, at least you did one thing right.

209
13:11.600 --> 13:13.400
Do you have any idea how much it would cost

210
13:13.440 --> 13:14.360
to relocate those high-voltage lines?

211
13:14.360 --> 13:15.440
And the ownership is a mess.

212
13:15.480 --> 13:17.000
What if you get sued?

213
13:17.280 --> 13:18.800
You're blinded by a bargain.

214
13:19.160 --> 13:21.000
Ever stop to think why it's this cheap?

215
13:21.840 --> 13:22.600
Fine.

216
13:23.000 --> 13:24.040
I won't do it, then.

217
13:24.520 --> 13:25.000
Alright?

218
13:26.360 --> 13:28.440
Yeah, you should've realized that ages ago.

219
13:32.120 --> 13:35.160
When are you going to get your act together?

220
13:37.880 --> 13:39.120
Oh, come on.

221
13:40.120 --> 13:41.520
That's exactly why...

222
13:41.560 --> 13:42.960
I need you.

223
13:43.240 --> 13:43.880
Right?

224
13:44.680 --> 13:45.600
Now, get out.

225
13:46.800 --> 13:48.000
Come on.

226
13:48.080 --> 13:48.760
Pite,

227
13:49.120 --> 13:50.160
be honest with me.

228
13:51.280 --> 13:52.720
You're in debt again, aren't you?

229
13:53.200 --> 13:54.040
Spit it out.

230
13:55.000 --> 13:55.960
What are you talking about?

231
13:56.120 --> 13:56.920
There's no debt.

232
13:57.080 --> 13:57.520
Is that so?

233
13:57.600 --> 13:58.440
Where are you getting this from?

234
13:58.960 --> 13:59.840
Fine, then.

235
13:59.880 --> 14:00.920
You can leave now.

236
14:01.800 --> 14:02.520
P'Ing...

237
14:03.720 --> 14:04.440
Are you going to leave...

238
14:04.480 --> 14:05.440
or do I have to kick you out?

239
14:05.480 --> 14:06.840
Come on, what is your problem?

240
14:06.840 --> 14:08.400
You're wasting my damn time.

241
14:11.000 --> 14:12.440
Fine, I'm leaving.

242
14:17.640 --> 14:19.320
You two, take a good look.

243
14:19.880 --> 14:21.640
This is what you call pathetic.

244
14:21.680 --> 14:22.960
I gave him a lot of money last month.

245
14:23.000 --> 14:24.280
He's squandering money like crazy.

246
14:34.240 --> 14:36.440
P'Ing... I mean, Mr. Ing.

247
14:38.360 --> 14:40.720
The new semester is starting soon.

248
14:40.800 --> 14:42.920
Yok and I want to throw a party.

249
14:43.640 --> 14:45.080
Would you be able to make it?

250
14:48.400 --> 14:49.600
If I'm free, I'll stop by.

251
14:50.040 --> 14:50.920
Are you serious?

252
14:51.280 --> 14:52.400
Thank you, P'Ing.

253
14:52.720 --> 14:53.720
Where the hell do you think you are?

254
14:55.080 --> 14:55.840
Mr. Ing...

255
14:56.520 --> 14:57.960
If you have so much time, get your job done.

256
14:58.440 --> 14:59.440
-Get moving. -Yes, sir.

257
15:21.400 --> 15:22.760
How was the laser thing the other day?

258
15:22.800 --> 15:23.720
You know,

259
15:24.080 --> 15:25.360
laser tag.

260
15:25.400 --> 15:26.040
I was cooked.

261
15:28.400 --> 15:29.800
Laser tag, you know.

262
15:29.960 --> 15:31.320
Come on, cheers.

263
15:31.880 --> 15:32.960
You're finally here, P'Ing.

264
15:34.640 --> 15:35.440
Where's everyone else?

265
15:35.680 --> 15:36.840
They're over there chatting.

266
15:37.160 --> 15:38.440
Take a seat. I'll be right back.

267
15:39.560 --> 15:40.480
Eighty-eight point eight...

268
15:40.760 --> 15:42.040
How do you know? You're the owner or something?

269
15:42.080 --> 15:44.280
My dad used to be an electrician.

270
15:44.320 --> 15:45.120
Oh, really?

271
15:45.160 --> 15:46.320
Yeah, my dad.

272
15:46.400 --> 15:47.400
Where are these lights from,

273
15:47.400 --> 15:48.280
based on the design?

274
15:48.280 --> 15:49.000
Germany.

275
15:49.480 --> 15:50.720
-Definitely Germany. -Cheers.

276
15:52.080 --> 15:53.720
Hey, P'Ing?

277
15:53.840 --> 15:55.640
Whoa, hey there.

278
15:56.520 --> 15:57.720
Is your leg better now?

279
15:57.720 --> 15:58.920
Hitting me like we're best buds, huh?

280
15:59.840 --> 16:00.480
It's all healed up.

281
16:00.520 --> 16:01.960
-Really? -Let me come with you next time.

282
16:08.280 --> 16:09.960
Is Yok interning at your company?

283
16:10.400 --> 16:11.440
Oh, yeah.

284
16:12.960 --> 16:14.400
Don't work him too hard, though,

285
16:14.960 --> 16:16.760
or some girl will be heartbroken.

286
16:17.640 --> 16:20.640
What are you talking about? That's nonsense.

287
16:20.680 --> 16:21.400
Is that so?

288
16:22.680 --> 16:23.800
I actually work Yok so hard

289
16:23.840 --> 16:25.440
that he barely has time to grab a bite.

290
16:25.480 --> 16:26.800
Are you sure you're not worried?

291
16:27.560 --> 16:29.360
What's that got to do with me?

292
16:30.080 --> 16:31.200
Look, do you know?

293
16:31.840 --> 16:32.920
Some people...

294
16:33.120 --> 16:34.320
like things easy.

295
16:34.360 --> 16:36.120
Others prefer a challenge.

296
16:37.240 --> 16:38.600
But as for this nerd here...

297
16:40.600 --> 16:41.760
he loves pressure.

298
16:43.840 --> 16:45.240
I don't think you're a good fit for him.

299
16:45.280 --> 16:46.480
He's boring as hell.

300
16:48.200 --> 16:48.840
Right over there.

301
16:49.520 --> 16:51.200
You'd be a much better match for Itt.

302
16:52.040 --> 16:52.960
Are you interested?

303
16:54.080 --> 16:55.280
Itt is a real looker, you know.

304
16:55.920 --> 16:57.000
He's almost as handsome as I am.

305
16:57.040 --> 16:58.080
Don't overthink it.

306
16:58.080 --> 16:59.400
-He's cool. -He really is.

307
16:59.400 --> 17:00.400
Itt is good-looking, too.

308
17:01.000 --> 17:02.200
He's got that villain look.

309
17:02.360 --> 17:03.280
A bad boy, you know.

310
17:05.520 --> 17:06.319
Oh...

311
17:16.400 --> 17:17.200
What exactly are you getting at?

312
17:20.440 --> 17:21.319
What's wrong?

313
17:26.520 --> 17:27.720
Oh...

314
17:28.840 --> 17:30.160
It's nothing, really.

315
17:31.680 --> 17:33.720
I'm just...

316
17:34.280 --> 17:35.720
trying to find Itt a girl.

317
17:39.280 --> 17:40.120
Why, Yok?

318
17:42.040 --> 17:43.400
Still can't move on from her?

319
17:45.720 --> 17:46.320
Hey,

320
17:48.080 --> 17:49.320
can you really not move on?

321
17:53.280 --> 17:54.160
That's enough.

322
17:57.120 --> 17:58.600
You were embarrassing her.

323
18:02.560 --> 18:05.080
You're suddenly acting like a hero.

324
18:06.640 --> 18:07.400
Why?

325
18:09.080 --> 18:10.280
Do you have a thing for her?

326
18:13.000 --> 18:13.800
Look, Yok.

327
18:15.440 --> 18:16.400
I'll be blunt.

328
18:19.120 --> 18:20.720
Aren't you interested in giving me a chance?

329
18:23.080 --> 18:24.760
I promise...

330
18:25.400 --> 18:27.280
I'll make you so addicted to me...

331
18:30.080 --> 18:31.680
that you'll never want another woman again.

332
18:36.640 --> 18:37.360
P'Ing...

333
18:38.360 --> 18:39.880
Whether I like women or not,

334
18:40.720 --> 18:42.120
there's no way we could be together.

335
18:43.160 --> 18:44.640
I still respect you 'cause you're older,

336
18:45.440 --> 18:46.880
but if you keep acting like this...

337
18:47.680 --> 18:48.480
Acting like what?

338
18:48.920 --> 18:50.320
What are you going to do to me?

339
18:53.200 --> 18:54.440
Oh, nothing to say?

340
18:54.680 --> 18:55.640
I'll just give it a shot, then.

341
19:13.480 --> 19:14.320
Why?

342
19:18.120 --> 19:20.000
My moves are pretty top-tier, aren't they?

343
19:34.880 --> 19:36.800
Did you just slap me, the top dog?

344
19:37.160 --> 19:37.760
Huh?

345
19:38.160 --> 19:39.320
You started it.

346
20:09.280 --> 20:10.720
You should answer that.

347
20:10.760 --> 20:13.240
It's ruining the mood.

348
20:16.920 --> 20:18.240
Why are you calling at this hour?

349
20:21.200 --> 20:21.960
Yok?

350
20:24.320 --> 20:25.560
Yok, are you drunk?

351
20:28.360 --> 20:29.440
Where are you right now?

352
20:32.680 --> 20:34.320
Wait right there. I'm coming.

353
20:36.920 --> 20:38.560
You're gonna leave me hanging like this?

354
20:42.520 --> 20:44.400
Take care of it yourself tonight.

355
21:00.720 --> 21:01.360
Itt...

356
21:02.880 --> 21:03.600
Itt...

357
21:05.800 --> 21:07.200
Hey, Yok.

358
21:07.680 --> 21:08.400
Wake up.

359
21:10.120 --> 21:10.840
Come on, wake up.

360
21:14.040 --> 21:15.200
You're not exactly a small guy.

361
21:15.960 --> 21:16.760
Yok...

362
21:17.840 --> 21:18.800
What the hell is this?

363
21:19.440 --> 21:20.200
Hey.

364
21:20.440 --> 21:21.200
Wake up.

365
21:21.840 --> 21:22.680
Wake up.

366
21:25.720 --> 21:26.720
Hey, guys.

367
21:26.960 --> 21:28.280
Can you help me carry him?

368
21:34.320 --> 21:36.120
You're heavy as hell.

369
21:38.640 --> 21:39.320
P'Ing...

370
21:39.600 --> 21:41.200
-What? -Take Itt home as well.

371
21:41.200 --> 21:42.600
Yeah, you should worry about yourself.

372
21:42.640 --> 21:44.520
You're drunk as a skunk.

373
21:45.080 --> 21:46.920
You wouldn't even know if someone kidnapped you.

374
21:52.000 --> 21:53.680
It's always just me.

375
21:56.280 --> 21:57.480
Where is this place?

376
21:57.600 --> 21:58.840
Damn, you're heavy.

377
22:01.080 --> 22:02.200
I want to go home...

378
22:16.680 --> 22:17.560
Just go to sleep.

379
22:18.160 --> 22:19.400
You're heavy as hell.

380
22:20.040 --> 22:21.600
Oh, for the guy in the other room,

381
22:21.600 --> 22:22.880
just add his bill to this room.

382
22:22.920 --> 22:23.800
I'll go pay in a bit.

383
22:24.080 --> 22:25.400
Understood, sir.

384
22:25.400 --> 22:26.640
Let me know if you need anything else.

385
22:28.440 --> 22:29.160
Hey.

386
23:11.800 --> 23:12.760
You're playing hard to get

387
23:12.800 --> 23:13.960
even while you're fast asleep.

388
23:34.920 --> 23:36.240
I'll take your shoes off for you.

389
23:36.640 --> 23:38.120
You're not comfortable, right?

390
23:56.200 --> 23:57.800
Should I take your shirt off, too?

391
23:59.680 --> 24:00.880
It's not like it's dirty.

392
24:04.080 --> 24:05.160
Maybe I should leave it on.

393
24:10.960 --> 24:13.240
But will you be able to sleep well with it on?

394
24:14.760 --> 24:16.520
Since I'm already playing the good guy,

395
24:19.400 --> 24:21.240
shouldn't I go all the way?

396
24:26.920 --> 24:28.920
No, I can't.

397
24:37.160 --> 24:37.920
Better not.

398
24:40.680 --> 24:41.800
Nope...

399
25:49.400 --> 25:50.360
What are you doing?

400
25:51.600 --> 25:53.000
I'm just taking your pants off

401
25:53.040 --> 25:54.320
so you can sleep comfortably.

402
25:55.160 --> 25:56.120
Don't touch me.

403
25:56.240 --> 25:57.200
Get out of here.

404
26:07.520 --> 26:08.600
Do you know...

405
26:09.400 --> 26:10.600
that right now,

406
26:11.440 --> 26:13.680
you're way cuter than usual?

407
26:16.280 --> 26:17.360
With stuff like this,

408
26:18.560 --> 26:20.120
it all comes down to skill.

409
26:51.840 --> 26:52.560
P'Ing...

410
26:57.800 --> 26:58.320
P'Ing...

411
27:00.080 --> 27:00.760
P'Ing...

412
27:01.280 --> 27:02.480
What the hell are you doing?

413
27:07.520 --> 27:08.320
P'Ing, stop.

414
27:08.680 --> 27:09.520
Yok...

415
27:10.760 --> 27:11.920
I can't take it anymore.

416
27:13.640 --> 27:15.600
I've endured this for long enough.

417
27:16.520 --> 27:17.520
Please let me have this.

418
27:20.800 --> 27:21.360
P'Ing...

419
27:58.640 --> 27:59.840
Now we're even.

420
28:03.680 --> 28:05.400
Why are you making such a cute face?

421
28:17.640 --> 28:18.520
Come here.

422
28:19.200 --> 28:19.800
Good.

423
28:20.520 --> 28:21.240
Good.

424
28:22.640 --> 28:23.280
Good.

425
28:31.080 --> 28:32.640
With stuff like this,

426
28:32.640 --> 28:34.080
it all comes down to skill.

427
28:37.440 --> 28:38.080
Hey.

428
28:39.520 --> 28:41.800
Did this punching bag kill your family or something?

429
28:44.920 --> 28:46.040
Don't let your emotions drive you.

430
28:47.560 --> 28:48.680
Otherwise, you're going to lose.

431
28:49.320 --> 28:49.840
Alright?

432
28:55.160 --> 28:56.480
Sorry, P'Khun.

433
28:57.160 --> 28:57.840
Take a break.

434
29:05.440 --> 29:06.000
Itt?

435
29:08.520 --> 29:09.120
Here.

436
29:09.280 --> 29:10.160
Thank you.

437
29:11.760 --> 29:13.920
After drinking that much last night,

438
29:14.000 --> 29:15.480
you can still practice?

439
29:16.040 --> 29:16.840
It's a breeze.

440
29:17.600 --> 29:18.640
How are you doing?

441
29:19.640 --> 29:20.800
I'm feeling better now,

442
29:20.960 --> 29:23.000
but I've got a bit of a headache.

443
29:27.640 --> 29:28.440
Who's calling me?

444
29:32.880 --> 29:33.960
Hello, P'Ing.

445
29:40.600 --> 29:42.000
Why did you call me just now?

446
29:43.360 --> 29:44.640
Yok told me...

447
29:45.040 --> 29:46.720
that you took us to the hotel last night.

448
29:46.760 --> 29:48.440
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

449
29:49.760 --> 29:50.800
Oh...

450
29:51.560 --> 29:53.720
At least you know you were causing me trouble.

451
29:54.160 --> 29:55.840
Why drink if you can't handle it?

452
29:56.040 --> 29:57.280
You need to learn your limits.

453
29:57.320 --> 29:59.040
My friends were egging me on.

454
30:01.040 --> 30:02.520
Itt, listen to me.

455
30:02.920 --> 30:05.120
No one in our family has ever been a lightweight.

456
30:05.280 --> 30:06.480
Go get some practice in.

457
30:09.280 --> 30:11.360
I used to help Dad drink back then.

458
30:11.560 --> 30:13.880
Now it's your turn to help me out.

459
30:14.040 --> 30:14.840
You got it.

460
30:14.880 --> 30:18.040
From now on, I'll make sure I can drink on your behalf.

461
30:19.440 --> 30:21.280
Stop trying to suck up to me.

462
30:22.080 --> 30:23.320
Where are you? The hotel?

463
30:23.680 --> 30:25.800
I'm out already. I'm with Yok.

464
30:27.800 --> 30:29.280
How's Yok doing?

465
30:31.440 --> 30:32.520
Why don't you ask him yourself?

466
30:33.920 --> 30:34.920
Here, talk to my brother.

467
30:35.160 --> 30:36.360
[P'Ing]

468
30:39.600 --> 30:41.280
-No need. -Hey.

469
30:43.240 --> 30:45.360
What the hell? Why did he hang up?

470
30:51.080 --> 30:53.160
Hello, P'Ing. I'm sorry.

471
30:54.560 --> 30:55.800
Who hung up just now?

472
30:56.800 --> 31:00.080
I'm sorry. I hit the wrong button.

473
31:01.080 --> 31:03.440
Anyway, Yok said he already took his medicine.

474
31:03.480 --> 31:04.520
He's feeling better now.

475
31:06.160 --> 31:08.200
P'Ing, we're heading out to grab some food.

476
31:08.360 --> 31:09.640
That's all for now. Bye.

477
31:09.920 --> 31:10.560
You...

478
31:11.200 --> 31:11.840
Jeez.

479
31:12.600 --> 31:13.600
Dammit.

480
31:18.920 --> 31:21.600
He called me last night begging for help,

481
31:23.440 --> 31:24.720
and now he's acting all serious.

482
31:28.400 --> 31:29.240
What are you looking at?

483
31:37.880 --> 31:39.480
Why did you hang up on him?

484
31:51.160 --> 31:51.720
Yok,

485
31:53.360 --> 31:54.720
what's going on between you and P'Ing?

486
32:01.240 --> 32:02.320
Nothing's going on.

487
32:05.280 --> 32:07.800
I thought you'd stopped holding a grudge against him.

488
32:07.800 --> 32:08.840
You two seemed to be getting closer.

489
32:08.880 --> 32:09.960
What are you talking about?

490
32:14.960 --> 32:16.320
It's not a big deal.

491
32:16.440 --> 32:18.520
If you're close to him, just be honest about it.

492
32:21.360 --> 32:22.320
Don't think too much

493
32:22.320 --> 32:24.040
about how he used to tease me when I was a kid.

494
32:24.160 --> 32:26.400
It's just sibling stuff, anyway.

495
32:28.400 --> 32:29.800
You're the one who shouldn't overthink it.

496
32:30.080 --> 32:31.480
There's nothing between me and him.

497
32:32.760 --> 32:33.480
Okay.

498
32:38.600 --> 32:39.360
Ready to go?

499
32:40.280 --> 32:40.960
Yeah.

500
32:49.160 --> 32:49.960
Here.

501
33:04.280 --> 33:05.520
Hello, Mr. Ing.

502
33:05.760 --> 33:07.640
I heard from the secretary

503
33:07.680 --> 33:09.440
that you weren't coming in today.

504
33:09.800 --> 33:10.560
Oh...

505
33:11.560 --> 33:13.600
My body decided to wake up, so here I am.

506
33:18.400 --> 33:19.040
Look...

507
33:21.160 --> 33:23.080
That intern named Yok...

508
33:23.080 --> 33:23.960
Is he in today?

509
33:24.840 --> 33:25.440
Yok?

510
33:26.920 --> 33:29.240
Oh, the intern?

511
33:29.400 --> 33:30.240
He's here.

512
33:33.520 --> 33:34.320
Good.

513
33:40.440 --> 33:41.640
Yeah. Come in.

514
33:47.680 --> 33:49.280
What is it, Secretary Piang?

515
33:51.840 --> 33:52.920
I have some documents for you to review.

516
33:52.920 --> 33:54.560
Everyone is waiting for your approval.

517
34:00.920 --> 34:01.760
I see.

518
34:02.720 --> 34:04.120
Sure, I'll take a look.

519
34:06.200 --> 34:08.880
What are you even wearing?

520
34:09.920 --> 34:11.840
Why aren't you wearing the clothes I bought you?

521
34:11.880 --> 34:12.840
Why this outfit?

522
34:19.920 --> 34:21.960
If that's all, you can get back to work.

523
34:22.840 --> 34:24.719
Yok has some documents for you to review.

524
34:26.760 --> 34:28.320
I'll get back to work now.

525
34:30.760 --> 34:32.199
Secretary Piang...

526
34:33.960 --> 34:35.199
Secretary Piang...

527
34:35.719 --> 34:37.600
I'm heading back to work.

528
34:52.960 --> 34:53.679
What's this?

529
34:54.159 --> 34:54.960
It's work.

530
35:05.000 --> 35:06.080
I don't feel like reading.

531
35:07.320 --> 35:08.440
Read it to me.

532
35:15.720 --> 35:17.080
Fine, I'm just messing with you.

533
35:17.640 --> 35:18.680
You've done a good job.

534
35:21.520 --> 35:22.480
How about this?

535
35:23.120 --> 35:24.120
From now on, while we're here,

536
35:24.160 --> 35:26.240
we'll only talk about work, okay?

537
35:29.000 --> 35:29.640
If that's the deal,

538
35:29.640 --> 35:31.160
I'll treat you to dinner after work.

539
35:31.160 --> 35:32.640
Just name what you want to eat.

540
35:50.880 --> 35:52.120
I'm great in bed, too.

541
35:52.160 --> 35:53.840
I just proved it to you last night, didn't I?

542
35:54.560 --> 35:55.360
Who is it?

543
35:55.360 --> 35:56.320
We'll be nothing

544
35:56.360 --> 35:57.360
more than a boss and an intern.

545
35:57.400 --> 35:58.640
You just focus on your internship,

546
35:58.640 --> 35:59.840
and I'll focus on mentoring you.

547
36:00.680 --> 36:01.160
Is that okay?

548
36:01.200 --> 36:03.080
You and Yok are going to Pattaya?

549
36:03.120 --> 36:04.240
Can I come along?

550
36:04.280 --> 36:05.400
We're not going on vacation.

551
36:05.440 --> 36:06.560
It's enough with just me and Yok.

552
36:10.520 --> 36:11.040
Itt...

553
36:11.120 --> 36:12.120
Itt, hey.

554
36:13.400 --> 36:13.880
You want it?

555
36:13.880 --> 36:15.400
You said we'd only talk about work.

556
36:15.640 --> 36:17.040
What was all that at the beach today?

557
36:17.080 --> 36:18.400
Fine, I'll make you get over me.

558
36:18.400 --> 36:20.080
Can someone like you really pull it off?
